{"id":67336,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67336"},"modified":"2026-09-10T15:33:10","modified_gmt":"2026-09-10T14:33:10","slug":"i-corrida-e-caminhada-solidaria-correr-por-todos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/i-corrida-e-caminhada-solidaria-correr-por-todos\/","title":{"rendered":"I Corrida e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria &#8211; Correr por Todos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">I Corrida e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria &#8211; Correr por Todos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>I Corrida e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria &#8211; Correr por Todos 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 uma iniciativa desportiva e de solidariedade comunit\u00e1ria que assinala a Semana Europeia de Combate \u00e0 Pobreza e \u00e0 Exclus\u00e3o Social da EAPN. Promovida pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e<\/strong> em parceria estreita com o <strong>Clube de Atletismo de Viana do Alentejo (CAVA)<\/strong>, a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de \u00c9vora (AAE)<\/strong>, o <strong>Sport Clube Alca\u00e7ovense<\/strong> e o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Viana do Alentejo<\/strong>, o evento realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> na hist\u00f3rica vila das <strong>Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas<\/strong>, unindo atletas, fam\u00edlias e a comunidade local em torno de uma causa nobre.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com epicentro no acolhedor <strong>Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas<\/strong>, a prova oferece um programa abrangente com a <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> (circuito misto cronometrado para juniores, seniores e veteranos), a <strong>Marcha Pedestre de 10 km<\/strong> (percurso pelo trilho PR3 VNT) e provas urbanas dedicadas aos escal\u00f5es jovens (de benjamins a juvenis). Sendo um evento de forte cariz beneficente, as receitas l\u00edquidas revertem integralmente a favor dos projetos de apoio social da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e<\/strong>. Os participantes t\u00eam acesso a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal, postos de abastecimento, banhos nas Piscinas Municipais, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio opcional e lembran\u00e7a finisher para todos os que cruzarem a linha de meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas, Viana do Alentejo, \u00c9vora<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida), 10 km (Caminhada) e Provas Jovens<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e, Munic\u00edpio de Viana do Alentejo e Clube de Atletismo de Viana do Alentejo (CAVA)<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem Almo\u00e7o (At\u00e9 13 Outubro):<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com Almo\u00e7o (At\u00e9 13 Outubro):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Secretariado):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Marcha Pedestre \/ Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem Almo\u00e7o (At\u00e9 13 Outubro):<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com Almo\u00e7o (At\u00e9 13 Outubro):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Secretariado):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corridas Jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (FPA Competi\u00e7\u00f5es):<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Secretariado):<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, o local e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida Correr por Todos 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 18 de outubro de 2026, com ponto de partida e meta no Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas, concelho de Viana do Alentejo. A Corrida de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 09:30, a Caminhada de 10 km tem partida \u00e0s 09:35 e as provas jovens t\u00eam in\u00edcio sequencial a partir das 09:40.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa contempla a Corrida Pedestre de 10 km em circuito misto (para escal\u00f5es de juniores a veteranos M70\/F70), a Marcha Pedestre\/Caminhada de 10 km (percurso PR3 VNT, aberta a todas as idades) e as Corridas Jovens destinadas a benjamins, infantis, iniciados e juvenis com dist\u00e2ncias entre 300m e 1000m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o cariz solid\u00e1rio da prova e para onde revertem as receitas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova enquadra-se na iniciativa nacional da EAPN pelo combate \u00e0 pobreza e exclus\u00e3o social, revertendo a totalidade das receitas l\u00edquidas das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a favor da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e para financiamento das suas respostas sociais e apoio comunit\u00e1rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e as op\u00e7\u00f5es com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 13 de outubro de 2026, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Corrida de 10 km ou na Caminhada custa 8,00 \u20ac (sem almo\u00e7o) ou 10,00 \u20ac (com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo). Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de \u00faltima hora no dia da prova t\u00eam o custo de 15,00 \u20ac (com almo\u00e7o). As provas jovens s\u00e3o gratuitas atrav\u00e9s da plataforma da FPA. Acompanhantes podem adquirir senha de almo\u00e7o por 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado, abastecimentos e os balne\u00e1rios para banhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado abre \u00e0s 08:00 no Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas (com levantamento antecipado no s\u00e1bado anterior at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17:00 na Junta de Freguesia). A prova conta com 2 postos de abastecimento de \u00e1gua e apoio na meta, dispondo de banhos quentes nas Piscinas Municipais das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas (Rua Dom Afonso V) das 10:00 \u00e0s 13:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"I Corrida e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria - Correr por Todos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Viana do Alentejo\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e, Munic\u00edpio de Viana do Alentejo e Clube de Atletismo de Viana do Alentejo (CAVA)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, o local e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida Correr por Todos 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 18 de outubro de 2026, com ponto de partida e meta no Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas, concelho de Viana do Alentejo. A Corrida de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 09:30, a Caminhada de 10 km tem partida \u00e0s 09:35 e as provas jovens t\u00eam in\u00edcio sequencial a partir das 09:40.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa contempla a Corrida Pedestre de 10 km em circuito misto (para escal\u00f5es de juniores a veteranos M70\/F70), a Marcha Pedestre\/Caminhada de 10 km (percurso PR3 VNT, aberta a todas as idades) e as Corridas Jovens destinadas a benjamins, infantis, iniciados e juvenis com dist\u00e2ncias entre 300m e 1000m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o cariz solid\u00e1rio da prova e para onde revertem as receitas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova enquadra-se na iniciativa nacional da EAPN pelo combate \u00e0 pobreza e exclus\u00e3o social, revertendo a totalidade das receitas l\u00edquidas das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a favor da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Terra M\u00e3e para financiamento das suas respostas sociais e apoio comunit\u00e1rio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e as op\u00e7\u00f5es com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 13 de outubro de 2026, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Corrida de 10 km ou na Caminhada custa 8,00 \u20ac (sem almo\u00e7o) ou 10,00 \u20ac (com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo). Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de \u00faltima hora no dia da prova t\u00eam o custo de 15,00 \u20ac (com almo\u00e7o). As provas jovens s\u00e3o gratuitas atrav\u00e9s da plataforma da FPA. Acompanhantes podem adquirir senha de almo\u00e7o por 5,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funcionam o secretariado, abastecimentos e os balne\u00e1rios para banhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado abre \u00e0s 08:00 no Jardim P\u00fablico das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas (com levantamento antecipado no s\u00e1bado anterior at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17:00 na Junta de Freguesia). A prova conta com 2 postos de abastecimento de \u00e1gua e apoio na meta, dispondo de banhos quentes nas Piscinas Municipais das Alc\u00e1\u00e7ovas (Rua Dom Afonso V) das 10:00 \u00e0s 13:00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67338,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624],"event_type_2":[728,132,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67336","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-viana-do-alentejo-evora","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-evora","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-i-corrida-e-caminhada-solidaria-correr-por-todos.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67336","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67336"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67336\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67339,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67336\/revisions\/67339"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/67338"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=67336"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=67336"},{"taxonomy"